      "plainText": "CR-043 section 17 probe: the three paragraph-mark rules where text is left, and an emptied paragraph before a control (23 October 2026). Each case: BEGINn, the case, ENDn.\nBEGIN1 text left before a table: HEAD1A kept, HEAD1B deleted, the mark deleted, a table next\nHEAD1A T1R1C1\tT1R1C2\nEND1\nBEGIN2 a control whose last paragraph keeps text: LIST2A kept, LIST2B deleted, the mark deleted\nPLAIN2A in the control\nLIST2A \nEND2\nBEGIN3 an emptied paragraph before a control: HEAD3A HEAD3B deleted, the mark deleted, a control next\nBODY3A in the control\nEND3\nBEGIN4 an emptied last paragraph of a table cell: C4A deleted, the mark deleted; the cell keeps a paragraph?\nC4 first paragraph kept\nEND4\nBEGIN5 text left before a control whose first paragraph is a numbered item: HEAD5A kept, HEAD5B deleted, the mark deleted\nHEAD5A \nLIST5A in the control\nPLAIN5B in the control\nEND5\nEND_OF_BODY\n",
